### Get best 10 stories
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/10

### Get best 5 stories
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/5

### Get best 1 story
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/1

### Invalid - count is 0 (should return 400)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/0

### Invalid - count is negative (should return 400)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/-1

### Invalid - count exceeds limit (should return 400)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/501

### Get best 20 stories
GET https://localhost:5001/api/stories/best/20

